        "Printers: a “Find on the network” button in the add-printer window — the program listens to what printers announce about themselves and fills in the form. A printer that changed its address is recognised by its serial number, and the new address is confirmed with one button. You still enter the access code yourself: it is not sent over the network.",
        "Printers: the add-printer window is a panel at the left edge of the screen with the groups “Printer”, “Connection”, “Bambu Lab” and “For testing”; a configured printer can be copied with “Save copy”. For testing there is a virtual printer: it needs no address or code, and it goes through printing, the queue, stock and counting for real.",
