        "Printing: the queue. “Add to queue” on a file — and the program picks a free printer with the right material among those you allowed to start from the queue (a checkbox in the printer list). The print starts after your confirmation, which names the printer. A staged start on several printers survives a program restart and asks “Continue?” instead of carrying on silently.",
