        "Modules: Inventory — spools, locations, spare parts, binding spools to a printer, AMS slots and CFS slots, writing filament off by actual printing and returning it after a stop, a “will the filament be enough” check before the start, replacing an almost empty spool, checking the colour against what the printer reports, a currency of your choice.",
